<decisions>
  <decision #preserve-profile-binding { status = "accepted" }>
    <question ?>Halfcode 应保存 profile root 还是只保存 substrate plan？</?>
    <answer>
      <decision-text ?>保存 depa-flows 的 typed definition binding，同时保留其 substrate definition。</?>
      <rationale ?>Profile 决定产品 authoring policy；只保存 substrate 会丢失业务身份，复制 AST 又会产生 authority 冲突。</?>
    </answer>
  </decision>
  <decision #definition-only-loader { status = "accepted" }>
    <question ?>加载 AI workflow Unit 时是否创建执行对象？</?>
    <answer>
      <decision-text ?>不创建。Halfcode Unit loader 只 parse、validate、project definition。</?>
      <rationale ?>本 Mission 明确排除 runtime 与 RunGraph，执行对象属于后续独立边界。</?>
    </answer>
  </decision>
</decisions>
